# v1.0 conformance vectors are SHA-256-pinned by downstream consumers
# (cephios-core tests/vectors/UPSTREAM.json + test_vector_pin.py; @cephios/core
# likewise). Mark the vector tree -text so git performs NO end-of-line conversion
# on any OS — git-for-Windows autocrlf never rewrites LF->CRLF — keeping the bytes,
# and therefore the SHA-256 pin, byte-identical cross-OS (G12-D5 item c).
v1.0/** -text
